    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9966)\n- Schedule: every 30 minutes; `settings.timezone`: UTC.\n- Table `due_sent_rows` (`id`, `status`, `scheduled_at`, `claimed_at`, `updated_at`). Due rows: `status = 'due'` and `scheduled_at <= now()`.\n- Atomic claim: `UPDATE ... SET status = 'claimed' WHERE id = $1 AND status = 'due'` (overlap-safe).\n- Logs: `email_management_run_logs` (empty/completed runs), `due_sent_claim_logs` (per row), `workflow_error_logs` (errors).\n- Postgres credential: **Outreach Postgres**.\n- Admin email: Gmail API + **Outreach Gmail OAuth** to `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL`.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
